sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a ReserveNowRequest for a specific EVSE

    CSMS->>CS: ReserveNowRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>connectorType must be omitted<br>idToken.idToken <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken><br>idToken.type <Configured valid_idtoken_type>
    CS-->>CSMS: ReserveNowResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector(s) of the configured EVSE
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Reserved)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Reserved, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: Responds accordingly (StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a CancelReservationRequest for the reservation created at step 1

    CSMS->>CS: CancelReservationRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: reservationId must be equal to the id provided at step 1
    CS-->>CSMS: CancelReservationResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 7: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector(s) of the configured EVSE
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Available, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: Responds accordingly (StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse)
